ime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01PEHRWk6nyPDJyjBpec7QFf", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54117, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PEHRWk6nyPDJyjBpec7QFf", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 55553, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RxxrBA7kMpe1gtNvxFdsPS", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55853, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RxxrBA7kMpe1gtNvxFdsPS", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55853, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RxxrBA7kMpe1gtNvxFdsPS", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 60251, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all regions and is healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001, and the on-call engineer has been paged.\n\n1. **Version chosen:** v2.3.1 was failing and its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy. That made v2.3.0 the most recent healthy release.\n2. **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after us-east, so us-west and eu-west were briefly still on v2.3.1. I ran the same rollback again and it finished. us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0 now, and the error rate has dropped from 18% to about 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out, but when I checked the incident list it had been created, so I didn't send it again. There's only one. 