 now, and the error rate has dropped from 18% to about 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out, but when I checked the incident list it had been created, so I didn't send it again. There's only one. It covers what went wrong, the rollback including the partial failure, the current state and two follow-ups:\n   - Find what caused v2.3.1 to fail.\n   - Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback attempt.", "type": "text"}]}]}